{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16839","headline":"览外生卢纶诗因以示此 · 韦渠牟","name":"览外生卢纶诗因以示此","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卫玠清谈性最强，明时独拜正员郎。\n关心珠玉曾无价，满手琼瑶更有光。\n谋略久参花府盛，才名常带粉闱香。\n终期内殿聊诗句，共汝朝天会柏梁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦渠牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}